    dcterms:description "A recessively inherited condition with arrhythmogenic right ventricular dysplasia/cardiomyopathy (ARVD/C) and a cutaneous phenotype, characterized by peculiar wooly hair and palmoplantar keratoderma."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
