<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011541> rdfs:label "dilated cardiomyopathy 1J"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "An extremely rare autosomal dominant syndrome described in two families to date and characterized by moderate to severe sensorineural hearing loss manifesting during childhood, and associated with late-onset dilated cardiomyopathy that generally progresses to heart failure."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
