    dcterms:description "Hereditary cerebral hemorrhage with amyloidosis (HCHWA), Flemish type is a form of HCHWA characterized by an age of onset of 45 years of age, progressive Alzheimer's disease-like dementia and lobar intracerebral hemorrhage in some patients."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
