<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0980715> rdfs:label "cardiac conduction disease with or without cardiomyoopathy"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A rare genetic cardiac disease characterized by variably expressed atrial tachyarrhythmia (such as atrial flutter, paroxysmal or chronic atrial fibrillation, ectopic atrial tachycardia, or multifocal atrial tachycardia), infra-Hisian conduction system disease, and vulnerability to dilated cardiomyopathy. Age of onset ranges between childhood and adulthood."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
