<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0015523> rdfs:label "epithelioid hemangioendothelioma"^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
    dcterms:description "A low-grade malignant blood vessel neoplasm. It is characterized by the presence of epithelioid endothelial cells. The neoplastic cells are arranged in cords and nests, which are embedded in a myxoid to hyalinized stroma."^^<http://example.org/invalidDatatype> ;
